025), both set during the Jurassic World trilogy.Jurassic Park is one of the highest-grossing media franchises of all time. The film series is also one of the highest-grossing of all time, having earned over $6 billion at the worldwide box office as of 2022. The original Jurassic Park was the first to surpass $1 billion, doing so during its 2013 re-release. This was followed by each installment in the Jurassic World trilogy. | Jurassic Park (song): Jurassic Park (song) "Jurassic Park" is a novelty song by American parody musician "Weird Al" Yankovic, released as the lead single from his eighth studio album, Alapalooza, on October 5,...
